stops failing on timing-dependent PNG snapshot captures. Both fixes[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]address the underlying causes; neither is worked around by [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]regenerating goldens or by loosening the exact-equality PNG [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]comparison.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase/repos/plans/202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]fix_ci_bead_isolation_and_visual_flakes.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Restore bead-store isolation for the epic-work CLI tests[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]bead-fix[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bead-fix: give the unisolated epic-work CLI test the project_dir fixture[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]its siblings use, and close the same latent gap in the neighbouring [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]preview tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Contention repro harness and load-robust visual convergence[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]visual-converge[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual-converge: build a repeatable contention harness that reproduces [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the visual snapshot flakes locally, then make render-convergence [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]detection robust to CPU starvation instead of relying on a wall-clock [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]quiet period.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Guarantee the compared PNG frame is the converged frame[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]visual-capture[dim] · [dim][/dim]after visual-converge[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual-capture: eliminate the gap between the frame that convergence [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]proved 